            "review_text": "bbhesania\nIndia139 contributions\n0\nGreat bbq\nJun 2023 • Family\nWe went for lunch to Sumo bbq Vin plaza mall and ate heartily. The choice of meats are fantastic. They have beef, pork along with different salads and fruits. You can keep ordering and doing the bbq as you like and relish the meats. For dessert there is icecream. The service is a bit slow. They do not clear up in between and wait for you to finish your entire meal which shouldnt be the case as the tables are small with the bbq pit in the centre\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 2, 2023",
