            "review_text": "little Journeys\n9 contributions\n0\nWorst service of my life\nApr 2019 • Family\nI cannot tell you about the food as I didn’t want to spend my money here after being treated so poorly\nThere were seats dotted through the restaurant but they told us to come back in 15 minutes... When we came back,staff ignored us for over 10 minutes before someone came over to say they would clear a table for us now.. There were clearly several tables already available and the ones with dishes piled up were still not cleared after 15 minutes of waiting... we called someone over and they told us it would be another 15 minutes before we could be seated.. we asked them about the free tables and they said we couldn’t sit there and it would be more time but as soon as I mentioned trip advisor they suddenly had a table right then for us but after being ignored and being made wait so long I wasn’t ready to spend my money here...\nRead more\nWritten May 3, 2019",
