            "review_title": "Review at Sumo BBQ",
            "review_text": "Changsta888\nLondon, United Kingdom159 contributions\n0\nAwful service and one to avoid\nApr 2019 • Family\nA family of 8 of us for dinner.\n\nTerrible service seems like the waiting staff hope to remember what is ordered but few of any dishes actually delivered to our table without having to constantly remind them.\n\nThe various poor excuses given to us by the waiting staff was that items no longer available or in stock, kitchen staff had finish for the day, no gas in the kitchen, new untrained staff and when we complained suddenly there was food and they were willing to serve us and by that time our whole party was so fed up we decided to leave. If there was insufficient food stocks or that they were closing why take our service and then not deliver what you promise we would have happily have gone elsewhere.\n\nTerrible service and ok food, definitely one to avoid and go elsewhere as you will be disappointed ruined a great family evening.\n\nWe refused to pay full price and made the staff and management know how absurd the excuses were and how upset we all were especially elderly parents and children. We ended only paying for 7 people, further 10% off and all drinks taken off the bill.\n\nIf we could give this place zero stars we would.\n\nAwful avoid like the plague.\nRead more\nWritten April 9, 2019",
