            "review_title": "Review at Sumo BBQ",
            "review_text": "Adam L\n15 contributions\n0\nVery inaccurate food delivery.\nMar 2019 • Couples\nWas consistently brought incorrect food (even though I pointed out in the menu exactly what I wanted). Ordered one last round of food before the bill, only received 1 part of it and the bill. Service was fast and friendly, but very inaccurate. They also only let you order the all-you-can-eat/buffet if a. Minimum of 2 people eat it (can not order for 1 person). At 400,000VND/person, I expect much better service. Quality of meat was good, but I feel they changed out my metal grate too frequently (i actually like a little char on my BBQ). I asked them not to change it and they said they must, so I had to take all the meat I just placed on the grill, take it off the grill, then put it all back on... I don't know if they do this this due to lack of proper ventilation for the smoke or to slow your eating down, but either way its annoying.\nRead more\nWritten March 7, 2019",
